      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A published mapping row states that values of this ICH M11 element are held at this USDM attribute (a usdm-rdf property), under the target path and condition the row gives. The link is the mapping publisher's; m11-rdf identifies the M11 side of the row. An annotation property, so that an element can point at an OWL property without punning."
